    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "ועלה \/ ותעל",
      "rationale": "Khoebo ya go boela godimo: mantsu a mabedi a go namaga (עלה) a phapanahala ka nako ya go namaga ga phudi le bohlele — pego ye e laleditšwego e la tlase ka Sepedi"
    },
